msgid ""
"Public headers define API contracts. Configuration and platform references "
"connect the actual resolver and maintained records; a symbol in the API "
"index does not establish Board authorization or physical qualification."
msgstr "公共头文件定义 API 合同。配置和平台参考连接实际解析器及维护记录；API 索引中出现一个符号，不代表板级授权或实板资格。"
